ring s = fs.next();\n        List<Integer> braces = new ArrayList<>();\n        braces.add(-1);\n        for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); ++i) {\n            if (s.charAt(i) == '(' || s.charAt(i) == ')') braces.add(i);\n        }\n        StringBuilder out = new StringBuilder();\n        int max = 0;\n        for (int i = 1; i + 1 < braces.size(); i += 2) {\n            int open = braces.get(i);\n            int close = braces.get(i + 1);\n            insideTotal += wordCount(s.substring(open + 1, close));\n            out.append('_').append(s.substring(braces.get(i - 1) + 1, open));\n        }\n        out.append('_').append(s.substring(braces.get(braces.size() - 1) + 1));\n        String outside = out.toString().replace('_', ' ').trim().replaceAll(\" +\", \" \");\n        if (!outside.isEmpty()) {\n            for (String word : outside.split(\" \")) {\n                if (word.length() > max) max = word.length();\n            }\n        }\n        System.out.print(max + \" \" + insideTotal);\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <sstream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <algorithm>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nint insideTotal = 0;\n\nint wordCount(const string& str) {\n    string s = str;\n    for (size_t i = 0; i < s.size(); ++i) if (s[i] == '_') s[i] = ' ';\n    size_t start = s.find_first_not_of(' ');\n    if (start == string::npos) return 0;\n    s = s.substr(start);\n    size_t end = s.find_last_not_of(' ');\n    if (end != string::npos) s = s.substr(0, end + 1);\n    // collapse multiple spaces\n    string clean;\n    bool lastSpace = false;\n    for (char c : s) {\n        if (c == ' ') {\n            if (!lastSpace) {\n                clean += ' ';\n                lastSpace = true;\n            }\n        } else {\n            clean += c;\n            lastSpace = false;\n        }\n    }\n    if (clean.empty()) return 0;\n    int count = 1;\n    for (char c : clean) if (c == ' ') ++count;\n    return count;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int n;\n    string s;\n    cin >> n >> s;\n    vector<int> braces;\n    braces.push_back(-1);\n    for (int i = 0; i < (int)s.size(); ++i) {\n        if (s[i] == '(' || s[i] == ')') braces.push_back(i);\n    }\n    int maxLen = 0;\n    string out;\n    for (size_t i = 1; i + 1 < braces.size(); i += 2) {\n        int open = braces[i];\n        int close = braces[i + 1];\n        insideTotal += wordCount(s.substr(open + 1, close - open - 1));\n        out.push_back('_');\n        out += s.substr(braces[i - 1] + 1, open - braces[i - 1] - 1);\n    }\n    out.push_back('_');\n    out += s.substr(braces.back() + 1);\n    for (char& c : out) if (c == '_') c = ' ';\n    // trim and collapse spaces\n    size_t start = out.find_first_not_of(' ');\n    if (start == string::npos) {\n        out.clear();\n    } else {\n        out = out.substr(start);\n        size_t end = out.find_last_not_of(' ');\n        if (end != string::npos) out = out.substr(0, end + 1);\n    }\n    string outside;\n    bool lastSpace = false;\n    for (char c : out) {\n        if (c == ' ') {\n            if (!lastSpace) {\n                outside += ' ';\n                lastSpace = true;\n            }\n        } else {\n            outside += c;\n            lastSpace = false;\n        }\n    }\n    if (!outside.empty()) {\n        stringstream ss(outside);\n        string word;\n        while (ss >> word) {\n            if ((int)word.size() > maxLen) maxLen = (int)word.size();\n        }\n    }\n    cout << maxLen << \" \" << insideTotal << endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-4.2915253e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -0.00073096255, -0.00010132276, -1.03711545e-05, -0.080665156, -4.553691e-05, 0.0, -2.3841855e-07, -0.033028334, -2.9802277e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3508165, 0.0, -7.986991e-06, 0.0, -1.19